      "message": "fix(machine): refuse a malformed M-code in the machine editor\n\nA coolant code or live-tool word must be one M word: an uppercase M and\na whole number 0..=9999 (leading zeros fine). A bare M, MX, m8, M8.5,\ntwo words or a number past M9999 is refused by name under its field and\nblocks the save; the catalogue flags a hand-written file the same way.\nLive-tool word refusals are keyed per word so each shows under its own\nrow only.\n\nRefs #383\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
